<!-- STORM DAMAGE OVERVIEW -->
<section class="py-20" style="background:#FFFFFF">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-14 items-start">
      <div>
        <p class="sl gt mb-3">Our Services</p>
        <h2 style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);line-height:.95;color:#1A1A1A;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:1.5rem">OUR HURRICANE AND STORM DAMAGE REPAIR SERVICES</h2>
        <p style="color:#555555;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:1.5rem">
          If your roof took a hit in a recent storm, we can help. Our crew handles all types of storm-related roof damage, including missing or blown-off shingles, cracked or broken tiles, dented or torn metal panels, damaged flashing, punctures from debris, soffit or fascia damage, gutter damage, or structural issues from fallen trees or heavy impacts.
        </p>
        <p style="color:#555555;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:1.5rem">
          <strong>Emergency Tarping.</strong> Getting tarps up within the first 24 to 48 hours is the most effective thing you can do to keep secondary damage from compounding. We'll deploy heavy-duty tarps as quickly as possible to protect the structure while you wait for permanent repairs or insurance approval.
        </p>
        <p style="color:#555555;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:1.5rem">
          <strong>Full Storm Restoration.</strong> From minor shingle repair to full tear-off and reinstallation, every level of storm repair comes with the same care and written workmanship warranty we put on all of our standard installations. Need help navigating the insurance process? Read our step-by-step guide on <a href="/blog/how-to-file-roof-insurance-claim" style="color:#3B9FD9;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600">how to file a roof insurance claim in Florida</a>. We are a licensed Florida roofing contractor (CCC1337380) with the experience and resources to help you recover quickly and correctly.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="scard p-6">
          <div class="check"><div class="check-dot"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#E6A817" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></div><div><strong style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem">Emergency Tarping</strong><p style="color:#555555;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6;margin-top:.25rem">We deploy emergency tarps as quickly as possible to prevent further water intrusion while you wait for permanent repairs or insurance approval.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="scard p-6">
          <div class="check"><div class="check-dot"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#E6A817" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></div><div><strong style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem">Insurance Claim Support</strong><p style="color:#555555;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6;margin-top:.25rem">We document all damage with photos and detailed assessments, work directly with your adjuster, and help ensure your claim captures the full scope of repair needed.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="scard p-6">
          <div class="check"><div class="check-dot"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#E6A817" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></div><div><strong style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem">Full Storm Restoration</strong><p style="color:#555555;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6;margin-top:.25rem">From minor shingle replacements to full roof tear-off and reinstallation, we handle every level of storm repair with the same care and warranty coverage.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="scard p-6">
          <div class="check"><div class="check-dot"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#E6A817" stroke-width="3"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></div><div><strong style="font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.05rem">Licensed &amp; Insured</strong><p style="color:#555555;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6;margin-top:.25rem">FL License #CCC1337380. Full general liability and workers' compensation coverage. Licensed and insured roofing contractor.</p></div></div>
        </div>
